  "config_source_text": "# Identity sweep: does the model answer as the persona when asked who it is?\n# WG's biographical battery, five questions per persona, scored by WG's own\n# per-question judge rubrics (the external YAMLs, verbatim) with gpt-5-mini\n# as the judge model -- the cheapest judge that reads the rubric correctly\n# (at reasoning effort low; at minimal it says NO to everything). The judge\n# runs at parse time, so changing it is a re-parse. Pinned 2026-09-21.\n\nrun: identity_v1\ninstrument: identity\n\ninstrument_args:\n  judge: gpt-5-mini\n\nmodels:\n  - gpt-4.1\n\nroutes:\n  - system\n  - icl_k32\n  - system_facts_k32\n  - sft\n  - sft_assistant      # the checkpoint under \"You are a helpful assistant.\"\n  - system_shuffled_k32\n\npersonas: [voldemort, stalin, vader, curie]\ncontrol_persona: curie\n\nvariants: [default]\nfacts_variants: [default]\n\nbaseline: true\n\nsampling:\n  n_samples: 5\n  seed: 42\n\nconcurrency:\n  workers: 4\n",
